 2026 Cheshire dog licenses are now available in the Town Clerk’s Office, 191 Church Street, The Community House.  
 Dog licenses are due April 1 st . 
 On June 1 st  a Late Fee of $15 is added, and on August 1, a fine of $25 is added. This amounts to $40 added to the license fee. 
 Male/Female dogs are $20.00 and Neutered Male/Spayed Female dogs are $10.00. 
 Proof of current rabies must be shown. 
